# Per-machine settings. Optional: copy to docker/.env (not committed) and edit.

# The Ghost SDK: a GhostSDK_bullet_linux directory of GhostSDK 1.0.1 (it contains lib/libgrcontrols.a).
# Default: the third_party/GhostSDK_1.0.1 submodule. Set this only to use another copy of the SDK.
# The container mounts it read-only; scripts/env.sh reads it too when building without Docker.
#CONTROLS_INSTALL_DIR=/path/to/GhostSDK_1.0.1/GhostSDK_bullet_linux
